      "data": {
        "markdown": "## Add work as tasks\n\nCreate a local **task** when this workboard owns the work completely. Create a **portal** when another task graph owns it; consume that graph's exposed task surface. The resolved node remains a task—the portal is only its carrier and provenance.\n\nSource graphs own status, progress, priority, next action, and blockers. This workboard owns `data.board` placement, rank, pinning, review time, and source health.\n\nRun **Reconcile Workboard** after adding or changing sources. Automatic cards follow source status; pinned cards remain manually placed. See the graph-adjacent `SKILL.md` for the full derivation and validation procedure.",
        "memo": "Template guidance. Replace or remove after deriving a real workboard.",
        "link": "",
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "workboard-template"
        }
      }
    },
